# 17. Permission Symbols

The three basic permission symbols are:

```text
r = read
w = write
x = execute
- = permission not granted
```

Examples:

```text
rwx
```

Means:

```text
Read + Write + Execute
```

```text
r--
```

Means:

```text
Read only
```

```text
rw-
```

Means:

```text
Read + Write
```

```text
r-x
```

Means:

```text
Read + Execute
```

```text
---
```

Means:

```text
No permissions
```

